04\">operator=</a></td><td><a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_NetworkManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_ANM_01004\">[SWS_ANM_01004]</a></td><td>Verschiebezuweisung für NetworkHandle.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#SWS_ANM_01002\">~NetworkHandle</a></td><td><a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_NetworkManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_ANM_01002\">[SWS_ANM_01002]</a></td><td>Destruktor des NetworkHandle.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#SWS_ANM_01001\">NetworkHandle</a></td><td><a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_NetworkManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_ANM_01001\">[SWS_ANM_01001]</a></td><td>Konstruiert einen Handle aus dem InstanceSpecifier eines NetworkManagementPortInterface-Port-Prototyps.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#SWS_ANM_01008\">GetNetworkRequestedState</a></td><td><a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_NetworkManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_ANM_01008\">[SWS_ANM_01008]</a></td><td>Liest den angeforderten Zustand für PNC, VLAN oder physisches Netz.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#SWS_ANM_01007\">GetNetworkState</a></td><td><a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_NetworkManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_ANM_01007\">[SWS_ANM_01007]</a></td><td>Liest den aktuellen effektiven Netzwerkzustand.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#SWS_ANM_01012\">RegisterNetworkRequestedStateChangeNotifier</a></td><td><a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP/AUTOSAR_AP_SWS_NetworkManagement.pdf#nameddest=SWS_ANM_01012\">[SWS_ANM_01012]</a></td><td>Registriert maximal einen Notifier für Änderungen des angeforderten Zustands.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#SWS_ANM_01014\">RegisterNetworkRequestedStateChangeNotifier</a></td><td><a class=\"swsref\" href=\"https://www.autosar.org/fileadmin/standards/R25-11/AP